<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Texas Instruments is cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Texas Instruments is cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette downgraded Texas Instruments Inc to market perform from buy, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not available.</p>
<p>-- Texas Instruments closed Friday at 89-7/8.</p>
</text>
